mutation annotate schedule replay rows as newly saved reservations
detects OnlySavedSchedule
- SavedSource == source.event = "schedule" /\ source.outcome = "saved" /\ source.id # ""
+ SavedSource == source.event = "schedule" /\ source.id # ""

mutation derive annotations without a reservation ID
detects OnlySavedSchedule
- SavedSource == source.event = "schedule" /\ source.outcome = "saved" /\ source.id # ""
+ SavedSource == source.event = "schedule" /\ source.outcome = "saved"

mutation flag a reminder one tick before the grace period ends
detects OnlyDuePending
-    LET at == Due(kind) IN at # Missing /\ now >= at + Grace }
+    LET at == Due(kind) IN at # Missing /\ now >= at + Grace - 1 }

mutation skip the exact grace boundary
detects FlagsEveryMissingKind
-    LET at == Due(kind) IN at # Missing /\ now >= at + Grace }
+    LET at == Due(kind) IN at # Missing /\ now > at + Grace }

mutation flag a row with an invalid scheduled timestamp
detects OnlyDuePending
-    LET at == Due(kind) IN at # Missing /\ now >= at + Grace }
+    LET at == Due(kind) IN now >= at + Grace }

mutation treat a combined reminder as two separate planned kinds
detects OnlyDuePending
- Overdue == { kind \in source.pending :
+ Overdue == { kind \in IF source.pending = {"both"} THEN {"ready", "leave"} ELSE source.pending :

mutation only accept successful provider responses as recorded results
detects NoMarkForArchivedDelivery
-    { record.kind : record \in { r \in Related : r.event = "delivery" /\ r.id = source.id } }
+    { record.kind : record \in { r \in Related : r.event = "delivery" /\ r.id = source.id /\ r.outcome = "provider_accepted" } }

mutation a result for one kind suppresses the other kind
detects FlagsEveryMissingKind
- Unrecorded == IF SavedSource /\ ~Ended THEN Overdue \ Seen ELSE {}
+ Unrecorded == IF SavedSource /\ ~Ended /\ Seen = {} THEN Overdue ELSE {}

mutation suppress after any cancellation request including a rejected one
detects FlagsEveryMissingKind
-        \/ /\ record.event = "cancel" /\ record.id = source.id /\ record.outcome = "canceled"
+        \/ /\ record.event = "cancel" /\ record.id = source.id

mutation omit the previous ID when reading the archive
detects TerminalSuppresses
- Related == { r \in archive : r.id = source.id \/ r.previous = source.id }
+ Related == { r \in archive : r.id = source.id }

mutation suppress a delivery mark on an Apple diagnostic by itself
detects FlagsEveryMissingKind
-    { record.kind : record \in { r \in Related : r.event = "delivery" /\ r.id = source.id } }
+    { record.kind : record \in { r \in Related : r.event \in {"delivery", "apple_rejection"} /\ r.id = source.id } }
